      "text": "PUBLIC INVITATION\n\nIndignation protest against US bombing of Iran\n\nJune 22 Sunday 5pm\nBoy Scout Rotonda, Tomas Morato, Quezon City\n\nBagong Alyansang Makabayan is inviting fellow Filipinos to join an indignation action to protest the US bombing of Iran\n\nThe bombing further escalates the conflict in the region and exposes the US as the biggest threat to humanity and the mastermind behind Israel’s attacks on Iran and the ongoing genocide in Palestine. \n\nLet us show our solidarity with the people of Iran in resisting US-Israel aggression. \n\nWe challenge the Marcos Jr government to condemn the US bombing and to renounce the aggression of the US government. \n\nThis also highlights the urgency for the immediate removal of all US troops, missile systems, and facilities from the Philippines as they pose a real danger to the local population. \n\nCondemn the US-Israel bombings on Iran! \nResist US wars of aggression!\nStand with Iran!",
