      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/tribunephl/status/1936629662823911720",
      "text": "AUSTRALIA PARA SA BAYAN\n\nVice President Sara Duterte made it clear: She is in Melbourne 'PARA SA BAYAN.'\n\nNothing says national duty quite like holding a \"Free Duterte Now\" rally thousands of kilometers away from the Philippines. \n\nTo be fair, she wasn’t just there for slogans and selfies. Duterte also held \"consultation meetings\" with OFWs, seeking their inputs on issues and hearing out their struggles abroad.\n\nTruly, when in doubt, outsource patriotism. \n\nAustralia na ang bagong Luneta. | Photo courtesy of the Office of the Vice President\n\n#DailyTribune #SaraDuterte",
